### 2. The Workflows to Back Up the Badges
Create these files in `.github/workflows/` inside your repo.

**`.github/workflows/ci.yml`** – Validates Go, Python, and Node.js code
```yaml
name: CI Pipeline

on:
  push:
    branches: [ main ]
  pull_request:
    branches: [ main ]

jobs:
  validate-go:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-go@v5
        with:
          go-version: '1.21'
      - run: cd exporter && go mod tidy && go build -v ./...
      - run: cd exporter && go test -v ./...

  validate-python:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5
        with:
          python-version: '3.10'
      - run: pip install flake8 black
      - run: flake8 inference/server.py --max-line-length=120
      - run: black --check inference/server.py

  validate-node:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: '18'
      - run: cd relay && npm ci
      - run: cd relay && npm audit --production

  build-docker:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - run: docker-compose build